* Jacobian Lens: Gurnee et al. (2026), "Verbalizable Representations Form a
  Global Workspace in Language Models",
  https://transformer-circuits.pub/2026/workspace/index.html. Library:
  https://github.com/anthropics/jacobian-lens (Apache-2.0). The gemma-4-31b
