Activation-example corpus (N1B)
-------------------------------
The N1B neuron-labelling experiment ran over a local corpus that included
README/NEWS files from /usr/share/doc and documentation and source from
installed Python packages. That corpus (N1B_corpus.jsonl) and the verbatim
context text taken from it are NOT included; only statistics and
model-generated contexts are published. The same applies to the 40
documentation chunks used by R1 (token ids removed from R1_02_positions.json).
Regenerate locally with experiments/scripts/N1B_build_corpus.py,
N1B_04_analyze.py, and the R1_01/R1_02 scripts.
